<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-CZECH NOVAK PULLS OUT OF FRENCH OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECH NOVAK PULLS OUT OF FRENCH OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jiri Novak of the Czech Republic, who is suffering from a virus, has pulled out of the French Open, organisers said on Friday.</p>
<p>They said the Czech Davis Cup player, ranked 57 in the world, would be replaced in the men's singles draw by American Doug Flach.</p>
